WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.150
Add forces that point the same way; subtract those that point opposite ways.

2
00:00:06.052 --> 00:00:11.552
Forward, twelve hundred newtons. Backward, five hundred plus three hundred: eight hundred.

3
00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:17.203
Net force: twelve hundred minus eight hundred, four hundred newtons forward.

4
00:00:19.205 --> 00:00:24.080
With eight hundred newtons forward, the forces balance. The net force is zero.
